---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Parks on the Air in WA
description: Recent Parks on the Air activations from Western Australian parks, and a thank-you to the VK6 activators and hunters.
permalink: /portable/pota/
---
<header class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Portable · Parks on the Air</p>
    <h1>WA parks: recent activity</h1>
    <p class="lede">Who's been out activating Western Australia's parks lately, and a thank-you to the VK6 operators putting WA parks on the air. For live spots, see POTA itself.</p>
    <p class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://pota.app/#/" rel="noopener">Who's on air now? Live spots on pota.app ↗</a> <a class="button ghost" href="{{ '/portable/pota/stats/' | url }}">WA park activity and archive</a></p>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="wrap">
{%- if pota %}
  <div class="pota-grid">
    <section class="card pota-panel" style="--bar: var(--green)">
      <h2>Newly logged <small>last 7 days</small></h2>
      {%- if pota.recent.length %}<ul class="feed">{% for a in pota.recent %}{% include "partials/pota-act.njk" %}{% endfor %}</ul>
      {%- else %}<p class="muted">No new WA activations logged in the last 7 days.</p>{% endif %}
      {%- if pota.month.length %}
      <h3>Earlier this month</h3>
      <ul class="feed">{% for a in pota.month | limit(8) %}{% include "partials/pota-act.njk" %}{% endfor %}</ul>
      {%- endif %}
      <p class="small muted">{{ pota.monthCount }} WA activations in the last 30 days. Logs reach POTA when activators upload them, sometimes weeks later; late uploads show here when they arrive, marked "logged" with the upload date.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="card pota-panel" style="--bar: var(--accent)">
      <h2>Thank you, VK6 activators <small>most active, last 12 months</small></h2>
      <div class="table-scroll plain"><table class="lb"><thead><tr><th>Callsign</th><th class="r">Activations</th><th class="r">Parks</th><th class="r">QSOs</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      {%- for e in pota.activatorsYear | limit(10) %}<tr><td><b>{{ e.call }}</b></td><td class="r">{{ e.activations }}</td><td class="r">{{ e.parks }}</td><td class="r">{{ e.qsos | thousands }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody></table></div>
    </section>
    <section class="card pota-panel" style="--bar: var(--navy)">
      <h2>Thank you, VK6 hunters <small>parks worked worldwide</small></h2>
      <div class="table-scroll plain"><table class="lb"><thead><tr><th>Callsign</th><th class="r">Parks</th><th class="r">QSOs</th></tr></thead><tbody>
      {%- for e in pota.hunters | limit(10) %}<tr><td><b>{{ e.call }}</b></td><td class="r">{{ e.parks | thousands }}</td><td class="r">{{ e.qsos | thousands }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody></table></div>
      <p class="small muted">A partial list: POTA has no list of WA hunters, so this covers the {{ pota.totals.huntersChecked }} VK6 callsigns we can find as activators or as regular hunters of WA parks. Hunt parks too? <a href="{{ '/news/contact/' | url }}">Ask to be added</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <section class="pota-challenge card" style="--bar: var(--gold)">
    <h2>Parks waiting for a first activation</h2>
    <p><b>{{ pota.parks.never | thousands }}</b> of WA's <b>{{ pota.parks.total | thousands }}</b> parks have never been activated, {{ pota.parks.nearPerthNever }} of them within about 40 km of Perth{% if pota.parks.nearPerthExamples.length %}, such as {% for p in pota.parks.nearPerthExamples %}{{ p.name }} ({{ p.ref }}){% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}. NewsWest is always glad to hear about a first activation.</p>
  </section>
  <p class="pota-note small">Figures from <a href="https://pota.app/" rel="noopener">Parks on the Air®</a>, updated daily (last {{ pota.generated | perthTime }} Perth time). vk6.net is not affiliated with POTA. POTA is not a contest: get out and have fun. Callsigns shown are public on POTA; ask us to add or leave off yours.</p>
{%- else %}
  <p class="notice">POTA figures aren't available yet. In the meantime, see <a href="https://pota.app/">pota.app</a>.</p>
{%- endif %}
</div>
